
             DDWeekTop V1.0 For DayDream BBS - Quick documentation
             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  What it this thing?
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	Nice weektop utility for DayDream BBS

  Features
  ~~~~~~~~
	- Nice outlook
	- Fast (from harddrive, from diskdrives this is hell :)
	- Shows top up&downloaders of the current & last week.
	- Generates message (optional) when week changes.

  Configuration
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
	DDWeekTop looks it's configfile from the path that is defined
	in ENV:-variable DreamUtils. Configfile is called DDWeekTop.Config
	and it looks like this:

-------------------------------------------------- cut -------------------
DayDream:Wares/Bulletins/Bulletin.8
DayDream:Wares/Bulletins/Bulletin.9
DayDream:Configs/Weektop
H
E
C
I
2
1





;This week (.GFX/.TXT added autimatically)
;Last week (.GFX/.TXT added autimatically)
;Output format or - to use internal (.GFX/.TXT added autimatically)
;H = Handles, N = Real names
;E = EALL, A = ALL, N = No messages
;Message type. M=Mono, C=Color
;Message type 2. C=Custom, I=Internal
;Conf to place messages
;Base to place messages
-------------------------------------------------- cut -------------------

	Installing this shouldn't cause any problems.


Output format
~~~~~~~~~~~~~

	You may specify outlook of the WeekTop, if you specify textfiles
	for that. (Both .GFX and .TXT must be available)

	Textfile supports following control codes:

	%D - Weektop data (must be!)
	%U - Total bytes uploaded
	%B - Total bytes downloaded
	%F - Total philes uploaded
	%L - Total files downloaded
	%C - Total calls
	%S - Start date
	%E - End date
	%I - Version info (Must be!)

